    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "bankruptcy or whatever... it's just more paperwork and more shame. i feel like i've already lost everything anyway. i look at my life and there's nothing left but this debt and the stress. it's like i'm just waiting for the end to come, but it's taking too long. sometimes i just wish i could find a way to make it all stop right now, just to have some peace.",
